      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RAVEN FLY (2) scored two back in quick then drifted back and missed the frame latest finishing a 6 length 4th at this track (29.88). Tough to beat if on-song. VINTAGE TIGER (5) was prominent early from the tricky draw and did a fair job to be beaten one length into third (29.49) at this track in a Grade 5 over 515m. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Expecting another good run. NOT AGAIN (3) had won two starts on end leading into the last outing when strongly fancied but could only manage eighth (31.14) at Lithgow. Key runner who gets his chance to atone. GYPSY IBROX (8) ran an exceptional 29.43 win last time. Not to be underestimated.",
